//! The `x` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property defines the x-axis
//! coordinate of the top left corner of the SVG `rect` shape, `image` image, `foreignObject`
//! viewport or nested `svg` viewport relative to the nearest `<svg>` ancestor's user [coordinate
//! system](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CSSOM_view_API/Coordinate_systems). If
//! present, it overrides the element's `x` attribute.
//!
//! Initial: 0. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to the width of the current SVG viewport.
//!
//! Grammar: <length-percentage>
//!
//! Specification: https://w3c.github.io/svgwg/svg2-draft/geometry.html#XProperty
//!
//! Author guide: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/x
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

